CITY ENGINEER’S OFFICE
2101 O’NeiI Avenue
Cheyenne, Wyoming 82001
(307) 637-6268
MEMORANDUM
TO:
Honorable Mayor Mañan J. Orr, City of Cheyenne
Members of the City Council, City of Cheyenne
THROUGH:
Amy Allen, P.E., City Engineer
FROM:
Sam Berta, City Construction Engineer
DATE:
July23, 2019
RE:
Contract Modification No. 3 to Contract No. 6839
Reiman Corp
Civic Center Commons Park Project
ORIGINATION
This Contract Modification was initiated and requested by the City Engineer’s Office.
This contract modification will be for additional work required by Reiman Contractors.
The
additional work includes the use of Fly Ash for the north parking lot, connecting the City of
Cheyenne’s Municipality building’s roof drain to the storm sewer main and final landscaping.
Final completion cannot be achieved until several items on the project are address.
First, the
north parking utilized Fly Ash to stabilize the subgrade which was saturated.
This insured
suitable paving conditions is a timely manner. Second, the main roof drain coming off the City
Municipality building must be connected to the new storm that was installed in O’Neil. The last
two items remaining to reach final completion on this project are bollards around the overhead
lights for protection and final landscaping for the north parking lot. This contract modification
will change the contract amount by $86,545.52 for the Civic Center Commons Project.
A Cc iir’itjrqrry ci’ C oici
